hehe.. simple.. fortunatly I am on my windows partition right now...
this is a snip from my defaults.nh file.

--snip--

OPTIONS=tile_file:tiles32X.bmp, tile_width:32, tile_height:32
OPTIONS=map_mode:tiles,scroll_margin:12


--end snip--

Simply put the tiles file into your nethack dir (mine was
tiles32X.bmp) set the height, width and map_mode and you are done. The
scroll_margin option is to keep my cursor more centered in the screen.

